    href: '/blog/can-dentists-repair-severely-damaged-teeth/',
  },
  {
    title: 'Can You Walk In for Dental Care?',
    excerpt: "Dental issues don't wait for appointments. Learn how walk-in dental care works and when it makes sense in Minnetonka, MN.",
    category: 'Patient Education',
    href: '/blog/can-you-walk-in-for-dental-care/',
  },
  {
    title: 'Does Insurance Cover Aesthetic Dentistry?',
    excerpt: "Botox, fillers, and other facial aesthetic treatments are usually cosmetic, not medical — which affects insurance coverage. Here's what's typically covered.",
    category: 'Aesthetic Dentistry',
    href: '/blog/does-insurance-cover-aesthetic-dentistry/',
  },
  {
    title: 'Does Insurance Cover Cosmetic Dentistry?',
    excerpt: 'Learn what dental insurance typically covers, when cosmetic procedures may qualify, and how our team helps you plan.',
    category: 'Cosmetic Dentistry',
    href: '/blog/does-insurance-cover-cosmetic-dentistry/',
  },
  {
    title: 'How Do I Choose the Best Dentist for Me?',
    excerpt: 'A practical guide to choosing the right dentist in Minnetonka, MN — what to ask, what to look for, and how to find a provider you can trust.',
    category: 'Patient Education',
    href: '/blog/how-do-i-choose-the-best-dentist-for-me/',
  },
  {
    title: 'How to Choose the Best Cosmetic Dentist in Minnetonka, MN',
    excerpt: 'Five factors to weigh when choosing a cosmetic dentist — experience, technology, real results, and personalized communication.',
    category: 'Cosmetic Dentistry',
    href: '/blog/how-to-choose-the-best-cosmetic-dentist-in-minnetonka-mn/',
  },
  {
    title: 'Esthetic vs. Cosmetic Dentistry: What’s the Difference?',
    excerpt: "What's the real difference between esthetic dentistry and cosmetic dentistry? We break down the terminology and what each approach prioritizes.",
    category: 'Cosmetic Dentistry',
    href: '/blog/is-there-a-difference-between-esthetic-dentistry-and-cosmetic-dentistry/',
  },
  {
    title: 'Your Guide to General & Family Dentistry in Minnetonka',
    excerpt: "From a child's first checkup to lifelong preventive care, explore general and family dentistry services for every generation.",
    category: 'General & Family Dentistry',
    href: '/blog/nurturing-healthy-smiles-for-every-generation-your-guide-to-general-amp-family-dentistry-in-minnetonka/',
  },
  {
    title: 'Professional Teeth Whitening: Restore Your Sparkling Smile',
    excerpt: 'Safe, dentist-supervised professional teeth whitening options — brighter results without the sensitivity of over-the-counter kits.',
    category: 'Cosmetic Dentistry',
    href: '/blog/professional-teeth-whitening-in-minnetonka-mn-restore-your-sparkling-smile/',
  },
  {
    title: 'Rejuvenate Your Look With Masterpiece Aesthetics',
    excerpt: 'Explore Masterpiece Aesthetics at Center for Smile Enhancement — Botox, dermal fillers, microneedling, and skin treatments.',
    category: 'Masterpiece Aesthetics',
    href: '/blog/rejuvenate-your-look-exploring-masterpiece-aesthetics-at-our-minnetonka-clinic/',
  },
  {
    title: 'Common Bad Oral Habits to Avoid',
    excerpt: 'From skipping flossing to using teeth as tools, learn the common bad oral habits that damage your smile — and how to fix them.',
    category: 'Patient Education',
    href: '/blog/what-are-bad-oral-habits/',
  },
  {
    title: 'Common Preventive Dentistry Services',
    excerpt: 'Discover the preventive dentistry services — check-ups, cleanings, fluoride, sealants, and screenings — that keep your smile healthy.',
    category: 'Preventive Dentistry',
    href: '/blog/what-are-common-preventive-dentistry-services/',
  },
  {
    title: '8 Risk Factors for Poor Oral Hygiene',
    excerpt: 'From diet to stress to skipped checkups, learn the 8 risk factors behind poor oral hygiene and how to protect your smile.',
    category: 'Patient Education',
    href: '/blog/what-are-the-8-risk-factors-for-poor-oral-hygiene/',
  },
  {
    title: 'Risk Factors Associated With Poor Oral Hygiene',
    excerpt: 'Poor oral hygiene affects more than your smile. Learn the dental, systemic, and financial risk factors — and how to protect your health.',
    category: 'Patient Education',
    href: '/blog/what-are-the-risk-factors-associated-with-poor-oral-hygiene/',
  },
  {
    title: 'The Three Levels of Prevention in Dentistry',
    excerpt: 'Learn about primary, secondary, and tertiary prevention in dentistry, and how each stage protects your smile.',
    category: 'Preventive Dentistry',
    href: '/blog/what-are-the-three-levels-of-prevention-in-dentistry/',
