    category: 'Cosmetic Dentistry',
    href: '/blog/what-is-the-least-expensive-smile-makeover/',
  },
  {
    title: 'The Most Popular Cosmetic Dental Procedure',
    excerpt: 'Professional teeth whitening is the most requested cosmetic dental treatment at our practice. See how it works and what else is available.',
    category: 'Cosmetic Dentistry',
    href: '/blog/what-is-the-most-popular-cosmetic-dental-procedure/',
  },
  {
    title: 'Dentist vs. Cosmetic Dentist: What’s the Difference?',
    excerpt: 'General dentists and cosmetic dentists both hold a DDS or DMD, so what sets them apart? We explain the difference in training and focus.',
    category: 'Cosmetic Dentistry',
    href: '/blog/whats-the-difference-between-a-dentist-and-a-cosmetic-dentist/',
  },
